WEBVTT

00:20:27.248 --> 00:20:32.194
If I, with the bleakness
of spirit -- with no spirit --

00:20:32.218 --> 00:20:35.319
that I had in the 1970s,

00:20:35.343 --> 00:20:38.038
and no possibility of recovery

00:20:38.062 --> 00:20:42.345
as far as that group of very experienced
psychiatrists thought,

00:20:42.369 --> 00:20:45.076
if I can find my way back from this,

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:48.433
believe me, anybody can
find their way back

00:20:48.457 --> 00:20:52.413
from any adversity
that exists in their lives.

00:20:52.437 --> 00:20:53.795
And for those who are older,

00:20:53.819 --> 00:20:57.387
who have lived through
perhaps not something as bad as this,

00:20:57.411 --> 00:20:59.779
but who have lived
through difficult times,

00:20:59.803 --> 00:21:02.143
perhaps where they lost
everything, as I did,